	* ChangeLog:
	  Update the ChangeLog.

2026-11-01 11:31  aleidinger

	* libmp3lame/version.h:
	  Enter beta phase.

2026-10-31 16:56  aleidinger

	* test/unit/test_albumart_pipe.sh:
	  Stop the album art pipe test from leaving a process behind
	  
	  The test opened the pipe once more to release a writer that might
	  still be waiting. When lame had already read the pipe, the writer
	  was
	  gone and that reader waited forever, so a run could leave a
	  process
	  behind. The test now ends the writer itself.

2026-10-31 16:23  aleidinger

	* maintainer/coverage-mp3x.py:
	  Check for the mp3x driver's GObject modules without unused
	  imports
	  
	  The probe now loads the Atspi and Gio modules with importlib. It
	  no
	  longer binds names it never uses, so pyflakes stops reporting
	  them.

2026-10-31 16:23  aleidinger

	* maintainer/coverage-mp3x.py:
	  Step the mp3x coverage driver past an early pause
	  
	  mp3x shows the frame READ_AHEAD frames behind the newest one.
	  When the
	  pause comes before that frame, Back stays disabled for up to
	  READ_AHEAD + 2 steps. The driver now steps until Back is enabled.

