	  Fix the ACM codec's stream close, size query and used source
	  length
	  
	  A close after a query open deleted whatever the application had
	  put into
	  the stream's instance data; the codec keeps its stream in the
	  driver's own
	  field now. The codec also returns a source size for a destination
	  size, and
	  does not count a partial sample frame at the end of the source as
	  used. A
	  conversion that ends the MP3 stream checks that the flush fits
	  before it
	  encodes anything.

