2026-08-27 14:10  aleidinger

	* libmp3lame/util.c, libmp3lame/util.h,
	  test/unit/test_choose_table_vector.c,
	  test/unit/test_quantize_lines_vector.c:
	  Ask __builtin_cpu_supports() only about names the compiler knows
	  
	  Whether the builtin exists and whether it knows a given feature
	  name are
	  separate questions, and a name it does not know is a compile
	  error: GCC 5
	  has the builtin without the AVX-512 names, so it cannot build
	  LAME.
