	* libmp3lame/encoder.c, libmp3lame/fft.c, libmp3lame/util.c:
	  Document the absolute threshold of hearing and the analysis
	  windows
	  
	  Describes the threshold formula and the curve types built on it,
	  the Bark
	  conversion, and the adjustment that scales the threshold to the
	  loudness of
	  the granule - including why that adjustment responds
	  asymmetrically, and that
	  switching it off is the only way to encode against a threshold
	  making no
	  assumption about playback level.
	  
	  The long-block analysis window is recorded as a to-do rather than
	  a fact: the
	  tree says the choice makes no real difference and does not appear
	  to have
	  measured it, and the two candidates differ in exactly the
	  property the
	  tonality estimate depends on.

