	* vc_solution/README.vs.txt:
	  Document what the DirectShow filter actually needs
	  
	  The build instructions asked for an SDK that Microsoft retired
	  years ago, and
	  for a solution inside it to be converted and built first. What
	  the filter needs
	  is the base class sources, which are published on their own, and
	  unpacking them
	  is the whole setup.

