	  reporting calls had no coverage at all. The histograms are pinned
	  through their invariants - what they sum to, and whether the two
	  dimensional tables agree with the one dimensional ones - rather
	  than
	  through any particular set of counts, so a future encoder change
	  moves
	  them without breaking anything.

