	* doc/maintainer-build-matrix.md, maintainer/gen-build-matrix.sh:
	  build: cover the frame analyzer in the configuration matrix
	  
	  The matrix built every optional surface except one: no cell
	  passed
	  --enable-mp3x, so the analyzer frontend was never compiled or
	  linked by it on
	  any platform. A change to those sources could pass the entire
	  matrix on every
	  compiler and still not build.
	  
	  There is a cell for it now, gated on GTK 4 the way the sndfile
	  cell is gated
	  on libsndfile, and probed with the same version constraint
	  configure applies,
	  so a GTK 4 too old to build the analyzer counts as absent here
	  rather than
	  producing a cell that cannot configure. Where GTK 4 is missing
	  the cell is
	  skipped with that reason recorded, which is the honest report: on
	  such a host
	  the analyzer cannot be covered at all.

