	* doc/doxygen/unit_tests.dox:
	  doc: document how to run the unit tests, and what "make test" is
	  not
	  
	  The unit-test page said which configure option turns the suite on
	  and
	  left the rest to be worked out. Added the operational half: that
	  the
	  option is what matters and having CMocka installed does not
	  enable
	  anything on its own, where the per-test logs and the collected
	  failure
	  log are written, and that a single test binary runs on its own.
	  
