	* libmp3lame/psymodel.h, libmp3lame/quantize_pvt.c:
	  Match array-parameter bounds between declaration and definition
	  
	  The energy array passed to the VBR psychoacoustic analysis holds
	  four
	  elements, but its declaration announced two, and the compiler
	  reported
	  the call it makes with that array as writing past the end. The
	  perceptual-entropy array in the bit-allocation helper was defined
	  with
	  an unspecified leading bound while its declaration gave one.
	  
	  State the bounds the callers actually pass. An array bound is not
	  part
	  of a parameter's type, so the generated code is unchanged.
	  
